Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 20:19:02 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Cover any US address and redesign the site

- Lookup works nationwide: Census geocoder returns city/town, school
  district and county for any address or GPS location
- New discover.py: Claude + web search finds the latest official agenda
  for bodies we don't scrape; the server downloads it and checks every
  number before marking items verified; results cached in Supabase
- Lookup matches stored items by body_name instead of returning every
  city's items; new POST /api/agenda; tax calculator takes any rates
- Frontend: per-government cards loading in parallel, use my location,
  shareable ?q= links, source links, filter counts, mobile + dark mode
- Docs: CONTRACT, DEVLOG (AI disclosure), README

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
